<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κικλήσκω</span></b> , poet. redupl. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλέω</span>, used only in pres. and
			impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call,
				summon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.606
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.532
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.397
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλήδην εἰς ἀγορὴν κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.11
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμυδις κικλήσκετο πάντας ἀρίστους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.300
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>invite</i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.404
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>invoke, implore</i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.569
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				212
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				217
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				508
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				209
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				470
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>accost, address</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴν Πατροκλῆος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.221
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>call by name</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν . . ἄνδρες Βατίειαν κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.813
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.291
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἐπίκλησιν κορυνήτην ἄνδρες κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.139
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				87.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				712
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				118
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔνομα Θεσμοφάνην με . . κίκλησκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.1337
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσός τις Συρίη κικλήσκεται</span>
			<i>there is</i> an island <i>called</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Συρίη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				15.403
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφ᾽ οὗ δὴ Ῥήγιον κικλήσκεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					402
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρὸς Στρυμόνος κικλήσκεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					279
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				652
			</span></i>.—Also in late 
				Ion.
			 Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SD</u>
				1.6
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), al.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληΐσκω</span>.</div>
